msgstr "Den Schnellstart-Assistenten ausführen"

#. settings-schema.json->onboarding_button->tooltip
msgid "Re-open the step-by-step setup guide."
msgstr "Den Schritt-für-Schritt-Assistenten erneut öffnen."

